            "review_text": "HanoiHopper_Alex\n1 contribution\n0\nMade my last night in Vietnam unforgettable\nJun 2026 • Solo\nI'd been traveling Vietnam for three weeks and saved Ho Chi Minh City for last. Monalux was the perfect send-off. There's something about listening to acoustic music in a beautifully designed lounge with a great cocktail in hand that makes you feel like you've truly arrived somewhere special. The band had a setlist that ranged from bossa nova to classic pop — all delivered with real warmth. Staff were lovely. Worth every dong.\nRead more\nWritten June 21, 2026",
