            "review_text": "TravellerSophie_AU\n1 contribution\n0\nA hidden gem in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City\nJun 2026 • Family\nMy partner and I were looking for somewhere special for our last night in Vietnam and Monalux delivered beyond our expectations. The intimate lounge atmosphere, live acoustic music, and expertly crafted cocktails made for a truly memorable evening. The space is beautifully designed — dimly lit with warm tones that set the perfect mood. We ordered a bottle of Macallan and the staff were attentive without being intrusive. Will absolutely return on our next trip to Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2026",
