            "review_text": "tony\n2 contributions\n0\nBest Acoustic Night in Saigon\nJun 2026 • Friends\nStumbled upon Monalux while exploring District 1 and it turned out to be the highlight of my entire Vietnam trip. The acoustic band was absolutely phenomenal — they played a beautiful mix of jazz standards and Vietnamese folk melodies that I didn't expect to love so much. The whisky selection is impressive and the bartender took time to recommend the perfect pairing. Staff were warm and genuinely welcoming to solo travelers. Highly recommend arriving before 9PM to get a good table.\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2026",
